    "updated_at": "2021-04-19T07:14:18Z",
    "body": "so i found a work around. i have no idea why this happens or why this fixes it, but if i change\r\n```\r\nset -g fish_user_paths \"/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin\" \"/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/sbin\" $fish_user_paths\r\n```\r\nto\r\n```\r\nfish_add_path \"/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin\" \"/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/sbin\" \"/home/user/.deno/bin\"\r\n```\r\n\r\neverything works fine\r\n\r\nI think this is not a bug in starship but since i don't really understand what's going on, not sure.",
